### --- Variaveis ---
### Assumir que voce tem um token admin valido
### e pelo menos um tenant criado

@base_url = http://localhost:8080
@token = SEU_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI
@specialist_id = SEU_SPECIALIST_ID_AQUI
@tenant_id = SEU_TENANT_ID_AQUI

### =============================================
### CRUD de Especialistas (Admin)
### =============================================

### Listar especialistas (HTML)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Listar especialistas — filtro por status
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists?status=active
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Listar especialistas — busca por nome
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists?search=Juridico
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Listar especialistas — HTMX (retorna fragmento tabela)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists?search=Juridico
Cookie: token={{token}}
HX-Request: true

### Formulario de criacao (HTML)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/new
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Criar especialista (form POST)
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Assistente Juridico&description=Atende leads de direito civil&prompt=Voce e um assistente juridico especializado. Seja cordial e objetivo.

### Detalhe do especialista (HTML)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Formulario de edicao (HTML)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/edit
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Editar especialista (form PUT)
PUT {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Assistente Juridico v2&description=Atende leads de direito civil e trabalhista&prompt=Voce e um assistente juridico. Peca os documentos necessarios.

### Desativar especialista
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/deactivate
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Reativar especialista
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/activate
Cookie: token={{token}}

### =============================================
### Associacao com Tenants
### =============================================

### Listar tenants associados (tabela completa)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tenants
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Card resumo (count + default) usado pela pagina do especialista
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tenants/summary
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Listar tenants gerenciaveis (todos + flag is_associated) — corpo do modal
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tenants/manage
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Idem com busca
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tenants/manage?search=Escritorio
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Sincronizar tenants — envia lista final de IDs marcados; backend calcula diff
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tenants/sync
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

tenant_ids[]={{tenant_id}}

### Listar tenants disponiveis para associacao (endpoint legado)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tenants/available
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Listar tenants disponiveis — com busca (endpoint legado)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tenants/available?search=Escritorio
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Associar tenant(s) ao especialista (endpoint legado, mantido para API)
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tenants
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

tenant_ids[]={{tenant_id}}

### Desassociar tenant do especialista
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### =============================================
### Testes OWASP
### =============================================

### A01 — Sem token (deve retornar 401)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists

### A01 — Token de usuario comum (deve retornar 403)
# Substituir pelo token de um usuario com role "user"
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists
Cookie: token=TOKEN_USER_AQUI

### A03 — SQL Injection na busca
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists?search='+OR+1=1+--
Cookie: token={{token}}

### A03 — XSS no nome
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=<script>alert('xss')</script>&prompt=prompt valido

### A07 — Token invalido (deve retornar 401)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists
Cookie: token=invalid.token.here
